    "input_text": "2024 Performance\nManagement Report\nCompany Profile\nManagement Discussion and Analysis\nGood Corporate Governance\nSustainability Report\n\nSejalan dengan dinamika bisnis yang semakin berkembang serta ketatnya persaingan perbankan berbasis digital, Allo Bank terus memperbaiki dan memperkuat struktur organisasinya guna mencapai tujuan yang telah ditetapkan. Struktur organisasi Bank terakhir disahkan melalui Surat Keputusan Direksi No. 082/DIRAB/24 tanggal 18 September 2024 tentang Perubahan Struktur Organisasi. Adapun struktur organisasi Bank di tahun 2024 dapat dilihat sebagai berikut:\n\nIn response to the growing dynamics of the business environment and increasing competition in digital banking, Allo Bank continues to enhance and strengthen its organizational structure to achieve its established goals. The Bank's current organizational structure was last ratified through the Decree of the Board of Directors No. 082/DIRAB/24, dated September 18, 2024, concerning changes to the organizational structure. Details of the Bank's organizational structure for 2024 are as follows:\n\n![img-77.jpeg](img-77.jpeg)\n\n2024 Annual Report &amp; Sustainability Report",
